      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olusooka mu mwezi ogwokusatu, mu mwaka ogweikumi n'omulala (11) nga tuli mu bunhage, Musengwa Katonda yankoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe omuntu, koba kyabazinga wa Misiri n'abantu be boonaboona oti:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nnaabageza ku ani omukologho ng'oti niimwe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agho ni, nze Musengwa Katonda kyenva ndi kukoba nti: Ng'omuti ogwo bwe gwaleegherera, obusanso bw'ensaga dhaagwo butuuka ni mu bire, era ni gwekuluntaza olw'obuleeyi obwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nze buti nguviireku. Era ndigughaayo mu ngalo edh'omufuzi ow'amaani, yaagubonereza olw'ebibi byagwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abamaghanga agandi abasingayo obukambwe baligutema baaguleka agho. Ensaga dhaagwo dhirigwa eyo dhityo ku nsozi ni mu biiko byonabyona, n'obusanso bw'ensaga dhaagwo bwamenhekera mu myala gyonagyona egy'amaadhi mu nsi eyo. Era abantu boonaboona ab'oku nsi baliva mu kinsense kyagwo baaja baaguleka agho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enhonhi edhiguluka dhoonadhoona dhiriidha dheebunga ku muti ogwo ghe guligwa, n'ensolo edh'omu nsiko dhoonadhoona dhaatyankirira ensaga dhaagwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo kiriba kityo, olwo ghalobe kubaagho muti gwonagwona guleegherera nga guli n'obusanso bw'ensaga dhaagwo obutuuka ni mu bire, waire nga guliba aghali maadhi. Era ghalobe kubaagho muti ogulinhwa amaadhi ni gutuuka ku buleeyi bwa gule, kuba emiti gyonagyona giteekwa kufa ng'abantu obuntu bwe bafa. Era giteekwa okuja mu nsi ey'abafu ghalala n'abo abaika eyo ghansi mu lwina.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda era akoba ati: “Omuti ogwo bwe guliserengeta e magombe, ndireetera emiiga egy'omu itaka okulira olwagwo. Ndirekeza emiiga n'ensulo okukuuluula, naaleeta enzikiiza ku nsozi edh'e Lebanoni, era naaleetera emiti egy'omu kibira gyonagyona okukala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe ndigusuula e magombe ghalala n'abo abaika eyo mu lwina, omuvuuma ogw'okugwa kwagwo gulitengeesa amaghanga. Emiti gyonagyona egy'omu Edeni, n'egyo egy'e Lebanoni gyonagyona egisinga bulungi egyanhwa amaadhi, era egyaserengeta mu itaka, girisangaala olw'okugwa kwagwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Girija nagwo mu nsi ey'abafu, eri abo abaamala eira okwitirwa mu ntalo. Bwenebwene abo abaabanga mu kinsense kyagwo balisansaanira mu maghanga baazikirira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu miti gyonagyona egy'omu Edeni, nnaakugeza ku guli gha, mu kitiibwa ni mu bukologho? Aye era weena oliika ghansi ghalala n'emiti egy'omu Edeni, waaba eyo mu nsi ey'abafu ghalala n'abatatya Katonda abo abataali bakekete abaitirwa mu lutalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omuti ogwo ni kyabazinga wa Misiri n'abantu be boonaboona. Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze nkobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
